---

<section
  id="work"
  class="snap-section relative min-h-[100dvh] bg-[#d6efff] pb-24 pt-8 md:pb-32 md:pt-16"
  aria-label="作品展示"
>
  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] px-4 md:px-6">
    <header class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:mb-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-start md:gap-x-6 md:gap-y-2">
      <div
        class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 md:col-span-7 md:justify-start md:gap-5 md:pl-[clamp(0px,5vw,96px)] lg:col-span-6"
      >
        <img
          src={img.folder}
          alt=""
          data-reveal
          class="relative shrink-0 block h-36 w-[128px] rotate-[-8deg] object-contain sm:h-40 sm:w-[140px] md:h-[10.5rem] md:w-[158px]"
          width="205"
          height="177"
        />
        <h2
          data-reveal
          data-reveal-delay="1"
          class="min-w-0 text-left text-[clamp(1.45rem,3.6vw,3.25rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#142a46]"
        >
          <span class="block">选择一个感兴趣</span>
          <span class="block">的项目叭</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p
        data-reveal
        data-reveal-delay="2"
        class="max-w-xl justify-self-end text-right text-sm leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-[#0f172a]/60 md:col-span-5 md:max-w-[28rem] md:self-end md:pb-0.5 md:text-right lg:col-span-6"
      >
        除作品集已呈现的实习项目外，本板块补充个人学生项目及动态视频演示，进一步体现我在设计中的大胆探索与创意思维。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-6 md:gap-y-10">
      {
        cards.map((p, i) => (
          <a
            href={p.bilibili}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            role="article"
            data-reveal
            data-reveal-delay={String(Math.min(i, 4))}
            class={`group flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border border-[rgba(194,199,203,0.15)] bg-white p-5 text-inherit no-underline shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition-shadow hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#142a46]/40 ${p.col}`}
            aria-label={`${p.title} — 在哔哩哔哩打开视频`}
          >
            <div class={`${p.bg} overflow-hidden rounded-lg`}>
              <div class={p.mediaBox}>
                <img
                  src={p.cover}
                  alt=""
                  class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-200 group-hover:scale-[1.02] group-hover:opacity-95"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
                <span
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 flex size-14 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/45 text-white shadow-md backdrop-blur-[2px] transition group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-black/55 md:size-16"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <svg class="ml-0.5 size-7 md:size-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M8 5v14l11-7L8 5z" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
              <div class={p.titleRow}>
                <h3
                  class={`text-[26px] font-black leading-tight text-[#142a46] sm:text-[28px] md:text-[36px] md:leading-[44px] ${p.titleClass}`}
                >
                  {workTitleSegments(p.title).map((seg) =>
                    seg.latin ? (
                      <span class="font-work-card-title-latin">{seg.text}</span>
                    ) : (
                      <span class="font-work-card-title-zh">{seg.text}</span>
                    )
                  )}
                </h3>
                <span class={p.tagClass}>{p.tag}</span>
              </div>
              <p class={p.descClass}>{p.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))
